    "Thread 4-5 pieces of lamb, potatoes, and carrots onto each skewer.",
    "Grill skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, until lamb reaches 145°F (63°C).",
    "Let skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
